==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Magmortar|22}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Bursting Inferno''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Power Keepers|Charizard|6}} from the {{TCG|EX Power Keepers}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

